{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31037","headline":"黄河 · 薛能","name":"黄河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处发崑仑，连乾复浸坤。\n波浑经鴈塞，声振自龙门。\n岸裂新冲势，滩余旧落痕。\n横沟通海上，远色尽山根。\n勇逗三峰坼，雄标四渎尊。\n湾中秋景树，阔外夕阳村。\n沫乱知鱼呴，槎来见鸟蹲。\n飞沙当白日，凝雾接黄昏。\n润可资农亩，清能表帝恩。\n雨吟堪极目，风度想惊魂。\n显瑞龟曾出，阴灵伯固存。\n盘涡寒渐急，浅濑暑微温。\n九曲终柔胜，常流可暗吞。\n人间无博望，谁复到穷源。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}